Fixes https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310

@jlovejoy 
@seabass-labrax 
@swinslow

The Norwegian Licence for Open Government Data (NLOD) has a new version;
add NLOD-2.0 alongside NLOD-1.0.

Closes: #1261

This is a tracking issue for identification of [Parity-7.0.0](https://paritylicense.com/versions/7.0.0.html).

A pull request with an XML file, #949, was opened at the start of November in 2019.

@swinslow [helpfully suggested opening this issue](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/pull/949#issuecomment-593708209), to ensure it makes the docket.
